ro1990","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODA4MDMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FrancoCastro1990/CLI-FRONTEND-RUST/commits/a68fd1915f79f8d444f7b5a0aa83860e476605d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-28T07:40:43Z","email":"franco.castro.villanueva.90@gmail.com","name":"Franco Castro"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-28T07:40:43Z","email":"franco.castro.villanueva.90@gmail.com","name":"Franco Castro"},"message":"feat: soporte de variables de plantilla (--var) y sistema .conf con filtrado condicional\n\n- CLI: añadir opción --var (KEY=VALUE) y método parse_vars; wizard devuelve vars vacíos.\n- main: parsear vars CLI y pasarlas a TemplateEngine.generate.\n- template_engine: ampliar TemplateConfig (metadata, file_filters, options_metadata) y añadir VariableOption/TemplateMetadata.\n  - Parseo de .conf por secciones ([metadata], [options], [files]).\n  - Merge de variables CLI sobre valores por defecto.\n  - Implementar evaluate_file_condition para reglas (always/default, var_X, var_X_value).\n  - Implementar generate_boolean_helpers para crear helpers booleanos dinámicos (p.ej. style_is_scss, with_tests_bool).\n  - Aplicar filtrado condicional de archivos al procesar plantillas.\n  - Mostrar variables activas cuando se personalizan.\n- Plantillas: añadir/actualizar plantilla de component (.$FILE_NAME.tsx, .styled.ts, .stories.tsx, index.ts) y crear templates/component/.conf con reglas y opciones.\n- Docs: actualizar README y docs/TEMPLATE_GUIDE.md con uso de --var, formato .conf, ejemplos y guía de variables/condiciones.\n\nResumen: añade soporte runtime para variables de plantilla, configuración declarativa por .conf y generación condicional de archivos, además de actualizar plantillas y documentación.","tree":{"sha":"731a44650186ec79948fea677fcef3130799f893","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FrancoCastro1990/CLI-FRONTEND-RUST/git/trees/731a44650186ec79948fea677fcef3130799f893"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FrancoCastro1990/CLI-FRONTEND-RUST/git/commits/a68fd1915f79f8d444f7b5a0aa83860e476605d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36808031?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FrancoCastro1990","id":36808031,"login":"FrancoCastro1990","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODA4MDMx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FrancoCastro1990","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FrancoCastro1990/CLI-FRONTEND-RUST/commit/a68fd1915f79f8d444f7b5a0aa83860e476605d9","node_id":"C_kwDOPrQxIdoAKGE2OGZkMTkxNWY3OWY4ZDQ0NGY3YjVhMGFhODM4NjBlNDc2NjA1ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FrancoCastro1990/CLI-FRONTEND-RUST/comm