8771@gmail.com","name":"L-a-z-e"},"message":"feat(multi): complete phase5 features and CQRS seed data migration\n\n- seller registration flow: move from auth to seller-service with approval workflow\n- password reset: time-limited token with Redis, rate limiting\n- chatbot: multi-turn conversation history with configurable max turns\n- settlement: enterprise chunk-oriented batch with partitioning and scheduling\n- coupon/timedeal CQRS: seller-service events → shopping-service consumers\n- coupon/timedeal scheduler: distributed lock based expiration and activation\n- product CQRS: event-driven sync with ES indexing and inventory creation\n- user withdrawal: Kafka event propagation to blog/notification cleanup\n- blog follow: Feign-based feed API with follower post aggregation\n- seed data: migrate DataInitializer from shopping to seller-service via CQRS events\n- notification: add follow/withdrawal event consumers and test fixes","tree":{"sha":"47f49a5e96aa64aa2d9541f19f4257240bc9a94a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/L-a-z-e/portal-universe/git/trees/47f49a5e96aa64aa2d9541f19f4257240bc9a94a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/L-a-z-e/portal-universe/git/commits/4a13336f0479c116b15ffb6552336de47bf69ae0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64356748?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/L-a-z-e","id":64356748,"login":"L-a-z-e","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzU2NzQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-