":{"date":"2026-02-25T14:29:04Z","email":"yysi8771@gmail.com","name":"L-a-z-e"},"message":"fix(infra): resolve WebSocket/notification proxy and CORS issues in Docker/K8s\n\nNginx에 /notification/ 경로 프록시 규칙이 없어 WebSocket 및 REST 요청이\nSPA fallback으로 라우팅되던 문제와, CORS/WebSocket Origin 불일치로 인한\n403 에러를 수정한다.\n\n- Docker/K8s Nginx: /notification/ws/ (WebSocket upgrade) 및\n  /notification/ (REST) 프록시 location 블록 추가\n- K8s Ingress: /notification path 라우팅 및 WebSocket timeout annotation 추가\n- api-gateway Docker: CORS allowed-origins에 https://localhost:30000 추가\n- notification-service Docker: WebSocket allowed-origins에\n  https://portal-universe:30000 추가\n- notification-service K8s: WebSocket allowed-origins를\n  portal-universe.com → portal-universe로 수정","tree":{"sha":"8ac3718164ce3684e5cc39d7335f14f8f57c094b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/L-a-z-e/portal-universe/git/trees/8ac3718164ce3684e5cc39d7335f14f8f57c094b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/L-a-z-e/portal-universe/git/commits/ec47c444909fdcdeb3dfb026d0ff269999443091","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64356748?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/L-a-z-e","id":64356748,"login":"L-a-z-e","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MzU2NzQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/subscriptions","type":"Use