ps://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/L-a-z-e/portal-universe/commits/3b1eda4895bd7f75134b5bb3ba57ffc297d88a31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-22T03:43:05Z","email":"yysi8771@gmail.com","name":"L-a-z-e"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-22T03:43:05Z","email":"yysi8771@gmail.com","name":"L-a-z-e"},"message":"fix(security,k8s): permit actuator health sub-paths and use proper K8s probe endpoints [skip-docs]\n\nSecurityConfig (all 7 services):\n- /actuator/health → /actuator/health/** to allow liveness/readiness\n- K8s probes.enabled=true exposes /health/liveness, /health/readiness\n  but SecurityConfig only permitted /health exact match → 403\n\nK8s probe paths (6 services, auth/gateway already correct):\n- startupProbe: /actuator/health/readiness\n- livenessProbe: /actuator/health/liveness\n- readinessProbe: /actuator/health/readiness\n- prevents unnecessary pod restarts when external deps are temporarily down","tree":{"sha":"185fc6e74caa7a803d26ede0ea24d6250dabea37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/L-a-z-e/portal-universe/git/trees/185fc6e74caa7a803d26ede0ea24d6250dabea37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/L-a-z-e/portal-universe/git/commits/3b1eda4895bd7f75134b5bb3ba57ffc297d88a31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64356748?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L-a-z-e/followers","followin