n🔗 Integration:\n- Connected to backend API gateway on port 8000\n- Proper endpoint routing (/api/stable-diffusion, /api/story-ai, etc.)\n- Real-time service status monitoring\n- Error handling and user feedback\n\n🚀 Fully Functional:\n- All prompt forms now submit and show results\n- End-to-end AI service interaction\n- Clean, responsive UI design","tree":{"sha":"f60d346b05038d9db86198916c942a8b8a9b1405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tkapesa/AI-ORCHASTRATION-/git/trees/f60d346b05038d9db86198916c942a8b8a9b1405"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tkapesa/AI-ORCHASTRATION-/git/commits/45c1c817b8a5784bc9f79d7d31aae41b70750b58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Tkapesa/AI-ORCHASTRATION-/commit/45c1c817b8a5784bc9f79d7d31aae41b70750b58","node_id":"C_kwDOPslvHdoAKDQ1YzFjODE3YjhhNTc4NGJjOWY3OWQ3ZDMxYWFlNDFiNzA3NTBiNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tkapesa/AI-ORCHASTRATION-/commit/a9f858b3f8ba291da90cb4100f6b4619e4aec076","sha":"a9f858b3f8ba291da90cb4100f6b4619e4aec076","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tkapesa/AI-ORCHASTRATION-/commits/a9f858b3f8ba291da90cb4100f6b4619e4aec076"}],"sha":"45c1c817b8a5784bc9f79d7d31aae41b70750b58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tkapesa/AI-ORCHASTRATION-/commits/45c1c817b8a5784bc9f79d7d31aae41b70750b58"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tkapesa/AI-ORCHASTRATION-/commits/a9f858b3f8ba291da90cb4100f6b4619e4aec076/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-14T16:44:23Z","email":"user@Users-MacBook-Pro-2.local","name":"TK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-14T16:44:23Z","email":"user@Users-MacBook-Pro-2.local","name":"TK"},"message":"🚀 Complete AI Orchestrator System - Fixed CORS, Added API Gateway, Cleaned Workspace\n\n✅ Major Fixes:\n- Fixed CORS issues blocking frontend-backend communication\n- Added main API gateway with /api/* routes for frontend\n- Fixed service URL mappings to localhost ports\n- Resolved form submission issues - all AI modules now working\n\n🏗️ System Architecture:\n- Backend API Gateway: Port 8000 (routes to AI services)\n- Frontend Dashboard: Port 3000 (React/TypeScript)\n- 5 AI Services: Ports 8083-8087 (all healthy)\n\n🧹 Workspace Cleanup:\n- Removed 20+ duplicate/unused files\n- Cleaned directory structure\n- Added comprehensive GETTING_STARTED.md guide\n\n🎯 Fully Functional:\n- Story AI, Character Chat, AnimateDiff, Voice AI, AI Collab all working\n- End-to-end form submissions with results display\n- Proper error handling and health monitoring","tree":{"sha":"2468d1deaeaf63848afc2452cd693310c89daa83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tkapesa/AI-ORCHASTRATION-/git/trees/2468d1deaeaf63848afc2452cd693310c89daa83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tkapesa/AI-ORCHASTRATION-/git/commits/a9f858b3f8ba291da90cb4100f6b4619e4aec076","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Tkapesa/AI-ORCHASTRATION-/commit/a9f858b3f8ba291da90cb4100f6b4619e4aec076","node_id":"C_kwDOPslvHdoAKGE5Zjg1OGIzZjhiYTI5MWRhOTBjYjQxMDBmNmI0NjE5ZTRhZWMwNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Tkapesa/AI-ORCHASTRATION-/commit/a0419ce27162e0fecf66c2d7cdedc43be88ff01e","sha":"a0419ce27162e0fecf66c2d7cdedc43be88ff01e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tkapesa/AI-ORCHASTRATION-/commits/a0419ce27162e0fecf66c2d7cdedc43be88ff01e"}],"sha":"a9f858b3f8ba291da90cb4100f6b4619e4aec076","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tkapesa/AI-ORCHASTRATION-/commits/a9f858b3f8ba291da90cb4100f6b4619e4aec076"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tkapesa/AI-ORCHASTRATION-/commits/a0419ce27162e0fecf66c2d7cdedc43be88ff01e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-09T11:39:49Z","email":"user@Users-MacBook-Pro-2.local","name":"TK"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-09T11:39:49Z","email":"user@Users-M