bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-12T22:23:12Z","email":"glideroggan@gmail.com","name":"GlideRoggan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-12T22:23:12Z","email":"glideroggan@gmail.com","name":"GlideRoggan"},"message":"feat: Implement Angular hoisting helper and update Angular MFEs\n\n- Added `hoistAngularApp` function to `mfe-helpers/angular` for defining Angular custom elements without importing Angular packages directly.\n- Updated Angular 18 and 20 MFEs to utilize the new hoisting helper, ensuring isolation of Angular versions and avoiding bare imports.\n- Introduced external dependencies for Angular MFEs in `angular.json` to include `mfe-helpers`.\n- Created type definitions for `mfe-helpers` and its submodules to provide better TypeScript support.\n- Refactored modal usage in Angular MFEs to import from `mfe-helpers/modal`.\n- Updated README to reflect the addition of the Angular hoisting helper and its usage.\n- Enhanced packaging of shared components to include subpath exports for better modularization.","tree":{"sha":"9f24dbfefa07c9942d66b8aa0e371aef5c2717f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/glideroggan/import-poc/git/trees/9f24dbfefa07c9942d66b8aa0e371aef5c2717f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/glideroggan/import-poc/git/commits/cdc8ab070a53ad3cc51da115898b1d783929a2bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4154398?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glideroggan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glideroggan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glideroggan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glideroggan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/glideroggan","id":4154398,"login":"glideroggan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxNTQzOTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/glider