modules, monorepo\n✅ Expo vs Bare Workflow (4 files) - Expo overview, bare workflow, comparison, migration\n✅ Error Handling & Recovery (4 files) - Error boundaries, patterns, recovery, analytics\n✅ Memory Management (5 files) - Leak prevention, optimization, GC, profiling, best practices\n✅ Cross-Platform Development (4 files) - Platform-specific code, responsive design, testing\n✅ React Native Ecosystem (4 files) - Popular libraries, evaluation, dependency management\n✅ Advanced Debugging (4 files) - Debugging tools, performance, memory, native debugging\n✅ Migration & Upgrades (4 files) - Version upgrades, breaking changes, architecture migration\n\n🔧 TECHNICAL FEATURES:\n- All examples use functional components with hooks (NO class components)\n- Copy buttons for all code snippets\n- Navigation links between related topics\n- Table of contents with anchor links\n- Mermaid diagrams for complex concepts\n- Interview questions for each topic\n- Best practices and common pitfalls\n- Real-world examples and use cases\n\n📊 STATISTICS:\n- 84 total markdown files\n- 21 major sections\n- 20 core topics\n- 64 advanced topics\n- Comprehensive coverage from beginner to expert level\n\n🚀 READY FOR:\n- React Native interview preparation\n- Production app development\n- Advanced React Native concepts\n- Enterprise-level architecture patterns\n- Performance optimization strategies\n- Security and privacy implementation\n\nThis documentation system provides complete coverage of React Native development from fundamentals to advanced topics, making it the ultimate resource for React Native developers at any level.","tree":{"sha":"f3ab237beedc10ccbf450994627443fd184a2ad0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ranvijay-Repository/InterView-Prep/git/trees/f3ab237beedc10ccbf450994627443fd184a2ad0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ranvijay-Repository/InterView-Prep/git/commits/1d0e3a7903b9c4246a8fd984154b6554801f3f22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":nul